   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28916",
   "off": 166166,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「港が再開して､ひとまず\r  ホッとしたよ」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"With the harbour open again, what a relief.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:2894d",
   "off": 166221,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「３日前に アンブローズ\r  のお偉いさんが\u0010\b  アモーク要塞に渡った\r  んだよ」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Three days ago, some bigwig from Ambrose\u0010\bcrossed over to Fort Amok.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:289a2",
   "off": 166306,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "何か御用ですか？",
   "en": "Is there something you need?",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:289ba",
   "off": 166330,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「港から 逃げ出す前に\r  ちらっと見たんだが…\u0010\b  光の渦から 化け物が\r  出てきていたようだ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I caught a glimpse before I ran from the harbour...\u0010\bLooked like monsters were coming out of a vortex of light.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28a19",
   "off": 166425,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「港に御用がおありですか？\r\u0017  ご相談したいことが\r  あるのですが…\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Have you business at the harbour? \u0017There is something I would like to discuss with you...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28a5e",
   "off": 166494,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  西の袋小路まで\r  来ていただけませんか？\u0019",
   "en": "Would you come to the dead end in the west?\u0019",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28a92",
   "off": 166546,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  そうですか…\r  その気になったら\r  また来てください」\u0010",
   "en": "I see... If you change your mind, please come again.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28acf",
   "off": 166607,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  それでは 西の袋小路で\r  お待ちしています」\u0010",
   "en": "Then I will be waiting at the dead end on the west side.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28b08",
   "off": 166664,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「今度の騒ぎと魔導聖堂が\r  関係ある？\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"The Temple of Sorcery, mixed up in this latest trouble?\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28b31",
   "off": 166705,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  めったなことは\r  言わんことだ」\u0010",
   "en": "You'd best not go sayin' such things.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES46:28b59",
   "off": 166745,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "壁には エルシノア湖周辺の\r地図がかけてある\u0010",
   "en": "On the wall hangs a map of the area around Lake Elsinore.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
